      "id": "CVE-2026-19568",
      "publishedDate": "2026-08-24T20:59:44.839Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-08-24T20:59:44.839Z",
      "description": "A maliciously crafted SVG file, when parsed through Autodesk 3ds Max, can force a Memory Corruption vulnerability. A malicious actor can leverage this vulnerability to execute arbitrary code in the context of the current process.",
      "severity": 7.8,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Autodesk 3ds Max\n🔓 漏洞类型：CWE-120 (CWE-120)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.autodesk.com/trust/security-advisories/adsk-sa-2026-0014",
          "type": "reference"
        },
